:"Computer 配置参考","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/computing/hugegraph-computer-config/"},{"id":"/docs/quickstart/computing/hugegraph-vermeer/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/computing/hugegraph-vermeer/index.md","title":"Vermeer: 高性能内存图计算框架","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/computing/hugegraph-vermeer/"}],"id":"/docs/quickstart/computing/","kind":"section","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/computing/index.md","title":"图计算（OLAP）","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/computing/"},{"children":[{"id":"/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/quick_start/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/quick_start/index.md","title":"LLM 使用流程","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/quick_start/"},{"id":"/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/hugegraph-llm/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/hugegraph-llm/index.md","title":"HugeGraph-LLM","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/hugegraph-llm/"},{"id":"/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/hugegraph-ml/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/hugegraph-ml/index.md","title":"HugeGraph-ML","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/hugegraph-ml/"},{"id":"/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/config-reference/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/config-reference/index.md","title":"配置参考","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/config-reference/"},{"id":"/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/rest-api/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/rest-api/index.md","title":"REST API","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/rest-api/"}],"id":"/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/","kind":"section","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/index.md","title":"HugeGraph-AI","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph-ai/"}],"kind":"external","title":"组件","url":"/cn/docs/quickstart/hugegraph/"},{"children":[{"children":[{"id":"/docs/clients/hugegraph-client/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/hugegraph-client/index.md","title":"HugeGraph Java Client","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/hugegraph-client/"},{"id":"/docs/clients/gremlin-console/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/gremlin-console/index.md","title":"Gremlin Console","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/gremlin-console/"},{"children":[{"description":"Graphs（图管理）REST 接口:管理图实例的生命周期,包括创建、查询、克隆、清空和删除图数据库。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/graphs/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/graphs/index.md","title":"Graphs","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/graphs/"},{"description":"Graphspace（图空间）REST 接口：多租户与资源隔离的创建、查看、更新与删除，以及使用前置条件与限制。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/graphspace/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/graphspace/index.md","title":"Graphspace","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/graphspace/"},{"description":"Authentication（认证鉴权）REST 接口:管理用户、角色、权限和访问控制,实现细粒度的图数据安全机制。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/auth/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/auth/index.md","title":"Authentication","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/auth/"},{"description":"Schema（图模式）REST 接口:查询图的完整模式定义,包括属性键、顶点标签、边标签和索引标签的统一视图。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/schema/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/schema/index.md","title":"Schema","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/schema/"},{"description":"PropertyKey（属性键）REST 接口:定义图中所有属性的数据类型和基数约束,是构建图模式的基础元素。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/propertykey/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/propertykey/index.md","title":"PropertyKey","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/propertykey/"},{"description":"VertexLabel（顶点标签）REST 接口:定义顶点类型、ID策略及关联的属性,决定顶点的结构和约束规则。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/vertexlabel/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/vertexlabel/index.md","title":"VertexLabel","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/vertexlabel/"},{"description":"EdgeLabel（边标签）REST 接口:定义边类型、源顶点和目标顶点的关系约束,构建图的连接规则。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/edgelabel/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/edgelabel/index.md","title":"EdgeLabel","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/edgelabel/"},{"description":"IndexLabel（索引标签）REST 接口:为顶点和边的属性创建索引,加速基于属性的查询和过滤操作。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/indexlabel/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/indexlabel/index.md","title":"IndexLabel","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/indexlabel/"},{"description":"Vertex（顶点）REST 接口:创建、查询、更新和删除图中的顶点数据,支持批量操作和条件过滤。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/vertex/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/vertex/index.md","title":"Vertex","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/vertex/"},{"description":"Edge（边）REST 接口:创建、查询、更新和删除顶点之间的关系数据,支持批量操作和方向查询。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/edge/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/edge/index.md","title":"Edge","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/edge/"},{"description":"Variable（变量）REST 接口:存储和管理键值对形式的全局变量,支持图级别的配置和状态管理。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/variable/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/variable/index.md","title":"Variable","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/variable/"},{"description":"Gremlin（图查询语言）REST 接口:通过 HTTP 接口执行 Gremlin 图遍历查询语言脚本。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/gremlin/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/gremlin/index.md","title":"Gremlin","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/gremlin/"},{"description":"Cypher（图查询语言）REST 接口:通过 HTTP 接口执行 OpenCypher 声明式图查询语言。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/cypher/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/cypher/index.md","title":"Cypher","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/cypher/"},{"description":"Traverser（图遍历）REST 接口:执行复杂的图算法和路径查询,包括最短路径、K近邻、相似度计算等高级分析功能。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/traverser/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/traverser/index.md","title":"Traverser","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/traverser/"},{"description":"Task（任务管理）REST 接口:查询和管理异步任务的执行状态,如索引重建、图遍历等长时任务。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/task/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/task/index.md","title":"Task","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/task/"},{"description":"Rebuild（重建索引）REST 接口:重建图模式的索引,确保索引数据与图数据保持一致性。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/rebuild/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/rebuild/index.md","title":"Rebuild","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/rebuild/"},{"description":"Rank（图排序）REST 接口:执行图节点排序算法,如 PageRank、个性化 PageRank 等中心性分析。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/rank/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/rank/index.md","title":"Rank","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/rank/"},{"description":"Metrics（监控指标）REST 接口:获取系统运行时的性能指标、统计信息和健康状态数据。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/metrics/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/metrics/index.md","title":"Metrics","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/metrics/"},{"description":"Other（其他接口）REST 接口:提供系统版本查询和 API 版本信息等辅助功能。","id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/other/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/other/index.md","title":"Other","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/other/"}],"id":"/docs/clients/restful-api/","kind":"section","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/index.md","title":"RESTful API","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/restful-api/"}],"id":"/docs/clients/","kind":"section","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/index.md","title":"客户端与 API","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/clients/"},{"children":[{"id":"/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client/index.md","title":"Java 客户端","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client/"},{"id":"/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client-python/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client-python/index.md","title":"Python 客户端","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client-python/"},{"id":"/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client-go/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client-go/index.md","title":"Go 客户端","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client-go/"}],"id":"/docs/quickstart/client/","kind":"section","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/index.md","title":"HugeGraph Client","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/quickstart/client/"},{"children":[{"id":"/docs/language/hugegraph-gremlin/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/language/hugegraph-gremlin/index.md","title":"Gremlin Query Language","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/language/hugegraph-gremlin/"}],"id":"/docs/language/","kind":"section","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/language/index.md","title":"查询语言","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/language/"},{"id":"/docs/guides/architectural/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/architectural/index.md","title":"架构概览","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/architectural/"},{"id":"/docs/guides/desgin-concept/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/desgin-concept/index.md","title":"设计理念(legacy)","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/desgin-concept/"},{"id":"/docs/guides/custom-plugin/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/custom-plugin/index.md","title":"HugeGraph Plugin","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/custom-plugin/"},{"id":"/docs/guides/toolchain-local-test/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/toolchain-local-test/index.md","title":"Toolchain本地测试","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/guides/toolchain-local-test/"}],"kind":"external","title":"开发","url":"/cn/docs/clients/"},{"children":[{"children":[{"id":"/docs/config/config-guide/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/config/config-guide/index.md","title":"Server 启动指南","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/config/config-guide/"},{"id":"/docs/config/config-option/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/config/config-option/index.md","title":"Server 完整配置手册","url":"https://hugegraph.apache.org/cn/docs/config/config-option/"},{"id":"/docs/config/config-authentication/","kind":"page","markdown":"https://hugegr